{"articleNo":"2877","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2877&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)생 학적사항 수정안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.06.28","hit":"10730","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"642\" height=\"845\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n            </p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"561\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"76\">\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)생</span></p>\n                        <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">학적사항 수정안내</span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)생 학적 수정사항을 아래와 같이 안내하오니 꼭 확인하여 주시고, 변경사항이 있을 시 수정하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;1. 학적사항 확인</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">『원스톱 → 학적부 → 학적자료조회』에서 내용 확인</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;2. 학적사항 수정 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">『원스톱 → 학적부 → 학적부기재변경』에서 수정</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">(수정사항은 본인의 변경된 연락처, 주소 및 이메일 등 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">수시 변경 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;3. 사진 등록 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">학적부 사진 등재는 학생증 발급 및 각종 학사업무 지원을 받을 수 있음</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 사진 제출</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 이메일(sjajpg@kumoh.ac.kr)발송 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ jpg 이미지 파일을 학번과 성명을 표기하여 이메일로 발송</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 직접방문 및&nbsp; 우편송부</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 주소 : 730-701 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;금오공과대학교 대학원지원팀(본관302호)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;※ 학적부사진 미제출시 주의사항</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">학적부사진을 미제출한 학생은 원스톱서비스 사용 제한 및 학사관련 업무</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(수강신청, 휴학신청, 성적확인 등 ) 불가</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">☆ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">본인의 학적사항을 수시로 확인하여 변경되는 즉시 관련 내용을 수정해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 93.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011.&nbsp;&nbsp; 6.</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 14pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅대학원)장</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"642\" height=\"13\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
